{
  "_doc": {
    "zh": "我们的肌肉（按英文名，去掉左右）对应到 OpenSim 模型里的哪些肌束。一条肌肉对应多个肌束时，最适纤维长度和肌腱单元长度取平均、最大等长力求和。只取模型里的三个数：optimal_fiber_length、tendon_slack_length、max_isometric_force。",
    "en": "Which fascicles of the OpenSim models our muscles correspond to (by English name without the side). When a muscle maps to several fascicles the optimal fibre length and the muscle-tendon length are averaged and the maximum isometric forces summed. Three numbers of the models are used: optimal_fiber_length, tendon_slack_length, max_isometric_force."
  },
  "map": [
